            "block_content": "The cam action of the spindle is determined in the following manner. An accurately machined test plate similar in design to the back plate of a chuck is attached. The DIAL INDICATOR button is positioned on the rear side of the test plate, as shown in Fig. 26.57. The tolerance is also indicated. For supplementary material on Cam Action refer to Sec. 16.11.",
